.TH FPACSTAT 1 "23 September 2011" Linux "FPAC Operator's Manual"
.SH NAME 
fpacstat \- Statistics element of the FPAC node."
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fpacstat
[\-c] [\-l] [\-h | \-V]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.LP
.B fpacstat
runs as one of the FPAC node elements. 
.B fpacstat 
computes the traffic statistics of the links to neighboring nodes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-?
show a short help and exit.
.TP
.B \-V
show the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-c
end the lines of the statistics files with CR.
.TP
.B \-l
log to the system log.
.P
Any unknown option or stray argument is an error: nothing is started.
.P
Only one
.B fpacstat
may run on a node. A second one refuses to start while the first holds the lock file
.I /var/ax25/fpac/fpacstat.lock
.SH FILES
.I /var/ax25/fpac/fpacstat.dat
.I /var/ax25/fpac/fpacstat.day
.SH AUTHOR
Bernard Pidoux F6BVP <bernard.f6bvp@gmail.com>
